# Edge case: five installations on DEPART_A (H01, H02, H03, the école, the
# dairy), exactly the `>= 5` of crowded_feeder: CrowdedFeeder. DEPART_B has
# two (H10, H11) and is not.
fact pv_h01 a Installation
  site site_26140000000101
  peak_power quantity(6 kW)
  commissioned date(May 12 2023)

